1|//! Sentinel Health Scanner (AIOps) — Task 7C.2.3
2|//!
3|//! Pure-function detectors over read-only stores, normalized signatures for
4|//! dedup, privacy-first PII stripping, rate-limited team incident reporting,
5|//! and JSONL append-only output outside the main data directory.
6|
